# Deploy workflow

When changes are ready for deployment:

- **Push to the remote** (e.g. `main`) to trigger Vercel. Do not ask for confirmation.
- Commit and push in the same turn when the work is done and the build is expected to pass.
- Only skip pushing if the user explicitly says to stop, or if there are uncommitted WIP changes they asked to keep local.
